WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.332 --> 00:00:16.174
Mara came out of Gumdrop Candy Store.

2
00:00:20.176 --> 00:00:21.257
She was chewing bubble gum.

3
00:00:21.277 --> 00:00:24.880
"Mmm," said Mara.

4
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.842
"This new bubble gum is delicious!"

5
00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:30.844
Mara blew a bubble.

6
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.281
The bubble grew and grew.

7
00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:38.322
"Why isn't this bubble popping?"

8
00:00:38.602 --> 00:00:39.302
Mara wondered.

9
00:00:40.223 --> 00:00:41.743
The bubble grew bigger and bigger.

10
00:00:44.184 --> 00:00:45.625
Soon it was bigger than a car!

11
00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:48.246
Mara screamed.

12
00:00:48.266 --> 00:00:54.969
"Ahh!" "I can't wait to play kickball," said Jack.

13
00:00:55.909 --> 00:00:58.631
Roxy, Terrell, and Jack were walking to Metro City Park.

14
00:00:59.591 --> 00:01:01.552
Jack was carrying his brand-new rubber ball.

15
00:01:02.636 --> 00:01:05.738
"Mara is meeting us at the park at two o'clock," said Roxy.

16
00:01:05.758 --> 00:01:08.941
"She said she had to finish her book report first."

17
00:01:14.705 --> 00:01:17.407
At the park the three friends played kickball for a while.

18
00:01:20.709 --> 00:01:22.430
Then they got a drink from the water fountain.

19
00:01:23.591 --> 00:01:24.852
Mara still wasn't there.

20
00:01:26.233 --> 00:01:27.074
"What time is it?"

21
00:01:27.354 --> 00:01:27.914
asked Jack.

22
00:01:28.815 --> 00:01:29.976
Terrell looked at his watch.

23
00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:33.121
"It's after two o'clock," he said.

24
00:01:33.141 --> 00:01:35.222
"Mara should be here."

25
00:01:35.242 --> 00:01:38.784
"I'm sure she'll be here soon," said Roxy.

26
00:01:38.804 --> 00:01:41.286
"Jack, kick the ball to me!"

27
00:01:43.987 --> 00:01:45.668
Roxy ran back across the field.

28
00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:50.190
Jack kicked the ball.

29
00:01:51.371 --> 00:01:52.492
It sailed through the air.

30
00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:54.453
"Got it!"

31
00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:55.313
called Roxy.

32
00:01:57.694 --> 00:01:58.975
She kicked the ball to Terrell.

33
00:01:59.575 --> 00:02:00.496
It went over his head.

34
00:02:01.464 --> 00:02:02.966
"You kicked it too hard!"

35
00:02:03.166 --> 00:02:03.886
Terrell called.

36
00:02:05.007 --> 00:02:06.088
He chased after the ball.

37
00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:11.653
The three friends kicked the ball back and forth for a while longer.

38
00:02:16.397 --> 00:02:19.079
But after thirty more minutes, Mara was still not there.

39
00:02:19.099 --> 00:02:22.962
"I wonder where Mara is," said Terrell.

40
00:02:22.982 --> 00:02:26.465
"Maybe she was kidnapped by aliens!"

41
00:02:26.866 --> 00:02:27.506
said Jack.

42
00:02:28.447 --> 00:02:29.308
Terrell laughed.

43
00:02:30.364 --> 00:02:32.845
"Maybe a big swamp monster attacked her!"

44
00:02:32.865 --> 00:02:36.407
"Ha-ha! Or a lava monster!"

45
00:02:36.647 --> 00:02:37.247
said Jack.

46
00:02:37.267 --> 00:02:39.548
"Or a giant octopus!"

47
00:02:41.229 --> 00:02:42.209
Roxy shook her head.

48
00:02:42.229 --> 00:02:48.072
"I doubt Mara was attacked by aliens or a monster or a giant octopus.

49
00:02:49.072 --> 00:02:51.233
She's probably still working on her book report."

50
00:02:53.154 --> 00:02:54.274
Terrell rubbed his chin.

51
00:02:54.294 --> 00:02:58.536
"Maybe Rocket Girl can find Mara," he said.

52
00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:00.341
Roxy laughed.

53
00:03:01.702 --> 00:03:03.664
"We don't need Rocket Girl to find Mara."

54
00:03:03.684 --> 00:03:07.727
"But Mara is missing," said Terrell.

55
00:03:07.747 --> 00:03:09.929
"This might be serious!"

56
00:03:09.949 --> 00:03:13.933
"I'm sure Mara is fine," said Roxy.

57
00:03:14.754 --> 00:03:17.676
"She's probably just—" Roxy's watch beeped.

58
00:03:19.578 --> 00:03:21.960
"Oh!" said Roxy.

59
00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:26.224
"I um, need to go tie my shoe."

60
00:03:29.992 --> 00:03:32.133
Roxy went over to a park bench and sat down.

61
00:03:33.773 --> 00:03:35.093
She pressed a button on her watch.

62
00:03:35.113 --> 00:03:39.335
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered.

63
00:03:39.355 --> 00:03:40.855
"What's wrong?"

64
00:03:41.915 --> 00:03:42.996
The mayor looked nervous.

65
00:03:43.016 --> 00:03:45.136
"Rocket Girl!

66
00:03:45.656 --> 00:03:49.017
A giant pink blob is invading downtown Metro City!

67
00:03:50.138 --> 00:03:51.098
We need your help!"

68
00:03:51.118 --> 00:03:53.719
"Whoa," said Roxy.

69
00:03:53.739 --> 00:03:55.479
"A pink blob!

70
00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.060
Don't worry, Mayor.

71
00:03:58.716 --> 00:04:00.459
Rocket Girl is on her way!"
